// Sum of kept winning labeled hammings equal to neither central value.
// An empty complement returns -1, not 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE hcneq ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG hcneq rank

IMPULSE hcneq 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "hcneq" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
